size: 1.17em; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px;\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"641\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Is there a limit to how many Instagram Reels I can create using The Social Planner?</strong></h3><p data-identifyelement=\"642\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 20px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px;\">There is no specific limit to the number of Instagram Reels you can create using The Social Planner. You can use the feature as often as you like to engage your audience and promote your brand.</p><p data-identifyelement=\"548\" dir=\"ltr\"><br data-identifyelement=\"549\"></p><p data-identifyelement=\"550\"><br data-identifyelement=\"551\"></p><p data-identifyelement=\"589\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; padding-top: 4px; color: rgb(24, 50, 71);\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\" data-identifyelement=\"590\"></p>\n\t"}, {"slug": "155000003320-calendar-widget-reorder", "title": "Calendar Widget Reorder", "folder": "Calendars", "images": ["../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155027906101/original/glSpF8cAt5sG0CexzkG9sBSG6JAxoPd85Qaa0a.png?1718859822", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155027905481/original/98hXW0y_j35qcQ00hkPZk1lUoWSLeM-cIA0ddb.png?1718858024", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155028841378/original/8Nu1uo6kB6dxGSZCn2jurojMPSm0iVR3Wwd43f.png?1720417588", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155027905523/original/M65oCDsCuRwVbakUevBLM4p9h285kJcrbQe5c3.png?1718858147", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155027905548/original/PqcAkP-XW2o_eLeeoVx57Bt9q6a1DKTzjQ0d09.png?1718858177"], "videos": [], "content": "\n\t\t<p class=\"fd-toc\"><strong>TABLE OF CONTENTS</strong></p><ul><li><a href=\"#Overview\">Overview</a></li><li><a href=\"#Configuring-the-Widget-Order\">Configuring the Widget Order</a></li><li><a href=\"#How-Does-This-Work?\">How Does This Work?</a></li><li><a dir=\"ltr\" href=\"#How-Do-Payments-Work?\">How Do Payments Work?</a></li><li><a href=\"#Calendar-Widget-Order-(Possible-Scenarios)\">Calendar Widget Order (Possible Scenarios)</a></li><li><a href=\"#FAQs\">FAQs</a></li></ul><hr><h3 dir=\"ltr\" id=\"Overview\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue;\"><strong dir=\"ltr\">Overview</strong></span></h3><p style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue;\"><br style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue;\">The Calendar Widget Reorder feature allows users to customize the order of steps in the calendar widget: the Date &amp; Time Selector, the Form, and Payments (if enabled). Users can choose whether they want the Date &amp; Time Selector or the Form to appear first, based on which the Payment step would be determined.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue;\"><br style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue;\">This feature is designed for businesses that want to collect lead information regardless of whether an appointment is booked.</span></p><hr style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"><h3 id=\"Configuring-the-Widget-Order\"><strong>Configuring the Widget Order</strong></h3><p><br></p><p><strong dir=\"ltr\">Note:</strong> This feature is available only for the NEO Widget.</p><ol><li dir=\"ltr\">Navigate to <strong dir=\"ltr\">Calendar Settings</strong> and select your calendar.</li><li dir=\"ltr\">Go to <strong>Forms &amp; Payments</strong>.</li><li dir=\"ltr\">Drag and reorder the Date &amp; Time Selector and Form to your desired sequence.</li><li dir=\"ltr\">Click <strong>Save</strong> to apply your changes.</li></ol><p><br></p><p><img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155027906101/original/glSpF8cAt5sG0CexzkG9sBSG6JAxoPd85Qaa0a.png?1718859822\" style=\"width: auto;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"155027906101\"></p><hr><h3 dir=\"ltr\" id=\"How-Does-This-Work?\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue;\"><strong dir=\"ltr\">How Does This Work?</strong></span></h3><h4 dir=\"ltr\" id=\"If-the-Date-Picker-is-First-and-the-Form-is-Second:\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue;\">If the Date Picker is First and the Form is Second:</span></h4><ul style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"><li style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"><h4 id=\"Process:-The-user-chooses-the-date,-fills-out-the-form,-and-schedules-the-meeting.\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue;\"><strong dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\">Process:</strong> The user chooses the date, fills out the form, and schedules the meeting.</span></h4></li><li style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue;\"><strong dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\">Outcome:</strong> The appointment is booked, a contact is created in the system and the form is submitted.</span></li></ul><h3 dir=\"ltr\" id=\"\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue;\"><br style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"></span></h3><h4 dir=\"ltr\" id=\"If-the-Form-is-First-and-the-Date-Picker-is-Second:\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue;\">If the Form is First and the Date Picker is Second:</span></h4><ul style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"><li style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"><h4 id=\"Process:-The-user-fills-out-the-form-first.\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue;\"><strong style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\">Process:</strong> The user fills out the form first.</span></h4></li><li style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue;\"><strong style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\">Outcome:</strong> A contact is created in the system immediately after the form is submitted. If the user then successfully books an appointment in the second step, the appointment is created in the system.</span></li></ul><hr style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"><h3 dir=\"ltr\" id=\"How-Do-Payments-Work?\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue;\"><strong>How Do Payments Work?</strong></span></h3><p><br></p><p style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue;\">If payments have been enabled, then the appointment creation depends on the payment status.</span></p><h4 id=\"-1\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"><br></h4><h4 id=\"Payment-Process:\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue;\"><strong dir=\"ltr\">Payment Process:</strong></span></h4><ul style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"><li style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue;\"><strong dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\">Duration:</strong> The user has 10 minutes to complete the payment.</span></li><li style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue;\"><strong dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\">Outcome:</strong></span><ul style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"><li style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue;\">If the payment is successful within 10 minutes, the appointment is booked.</span></li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue;\">If the payment is not completed within 10 minutes, the appointment is not booked, and the selected slot is reopened for others to book.</span></li></ul></li></ul><hr><h3 dir=\"ltr\" id=\"Calendar-Widget-Order-(Possible-Scenarios)\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue;\"><strong dir=\"ltr\">Calendar Widget Order (Possible Scenarios)</strong></span></h3><p><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue;\"><br style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\">1. Date Picker First with Payment disabled</p><p><img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155027905481/original/98hXW0y_j35qcQ00hkPZk1lUoWSLeM-cIA0ddb.png?1718858024\" style=\"width: 359px; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"155027905481\"></p><hr><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\">2. Date Picker First with Payment enabled</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"><img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155028841378/original/8Nu1uo6kB6dxGSZCn2jurojMPSm0iVR3Wwd43f.png?1720417588\" style=\"width: 355px;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"155028841378\"></p><p style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"><br></p><hr><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\">3. Form First with Payment disabled</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"><img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155027905523/original/M65oCDsCuRwVbakUevBLM4p9h285kJcrbQe5c3.png?1718858147\" style=\"width: 360px; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"155027905523\"></p><hr><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\">4. Form First with Payment enabled</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"><img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155027905548/original/PqcAkP-XW2o_eLeeoVx57Bt9q6a1DKTzjQ0d09.png?1718858177\" style=\"width: 592px; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"155027905548\"></p><hr style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"><h3 dir=\"ltr\" id=\"FAQs\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"><strong>FAQs</strong></h3><p><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\">Q. What happens when someone clicks back and submits the form again?</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\">A: If the form is resubmitted within the same session, multiple form submissions will appear. However, the details from the latest submission will be updated in the contact.</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\">Q: What happens to my form submission workflows?</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\">A: If form is first, then these are triggered as soon as the form is submitted. If form is second, then these would be triggered only if the appointment is booked successfully.</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\">Q: What happens to my appointment workflows?</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\">A: If payment is disabled, the workflows are triggered as soon as the appointment is booked. However, if payment is enabled, these workflows are triggered only after the payment is successfully completed. (The appointment is booked only when the payment status is successful)</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"><br>Q: I can't see the slot on the booking widget, and I don't have an appointment scheduled for the same time. Why is this happening?</p><p dir=\"ltr\">A: This can occur if someone has chosen a slot on the widget but hasn't completed the payment yet. In such cases, the slot is held for 10 minutes. If the payment is completed within this time, the appointment is booked, and it appears in the calendar view. If the session expires without payment, the slot is released and becomes available again on the widget for others to book.</p>\n\t"}, {"slug": "155000004781-important-update-whatsapp-marketing-templates-pause-in-the-u-s-starting-april-1-2025", "title": "Important Update: WhatsApp Marketing Templates Pause in the U.S. Starting April 1, 2025", "folder": "Setup", "images": ["../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155043282256/original/lC-Z_z-ny2Bu3XFHwuqvdOvqeWpckM6N_w9651.jpg?1741945242"], "videos": [], "content": "\n\t\t<div class=\"line\" style=\"border: 0px; font-size: 14px; margin-bottom: 15px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; display: block; line-height: 22px; word-break: break-word; color: rgb(32, 32, 32); font-family: Inter, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\">Starting April 1, 2025, Meta will pause the ability to send WhatsApp marketing template messages to U.S. phone numbers. Businesses can still send utility and authentication templates and respond within the 24-hour customer service window. This update does not affect marketing messages sent to other countries.</div><div class=\"line\" style=\"border: 0px; font-size: 14px; margin-bottom: 15px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; display: block; line-height: 22px; word-break: break-word; color: rgb(32, 32, 32); font-family: Inter, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\">What\u2019s Changing &amp; How to Prepare</div><div class=\"line\" style=\"border: 0px; font-size: 14px; margin-bottom: 15px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; display: block; line-height: 22px; word-break: break-word; color: rgb(32, 32, 32); font-family: Inter, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\">Meta is temporarily pausing marketing templates in the U.S. to optimize WhatsApp\u2019s long-term growth strategy. While marketing messages will not be delivered, businesses can still engage customers using Utility Templates and Click-to-WhatsApp Ads.</div><div class=\"line\" style=\"border: 0px; font-size: 14px; margin-bottom: 15px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; display: block; line-height: 22px; word-break: break-word; color: rgb(32, 32, 32); font-family: Inter, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><img alt=\"Screenshot 2025-03-04 at 4\" src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155043282256/original/lC-Z_z-ny2Bu3XFHwuqvdOvqeWpckM6N_w9651.jpg?1741945242\" class=\"tappable fr-fil fr-dib\" style=\"border: 0px; font-size: 14px; padding: 0px; max-height: 400px; max-width: 100%; cursor: pointer;\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"155043282256\"></div><div class=\"line\" style=\"border: 0px; font-size: 14px; margin-bottom: 15px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; display: block; line-height: 22px; word-break: break-word; color: rgb(32, 32, 32); font-family: Inter, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\">Introducing the AI-Powered Template Migrator</div><div class=\"line\" style=\"border: 0px; font-size: 14px; margin-bottom: 15px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; display: block; line-height: 22px; word-break: break-word; color: rgb(32, 32, 32); font-family: Inter, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\">To help businesses adapt to this change, we will soon release an AI-driven WhatsApp Template Migrator that will allow you to convert existing marketing templates into utility templates while preserving variables and media. This will help maintain seamless messaging, lower costs, and higher delivery rates. Stay tuned for its launch!</div><div class=\"line\" style=\"border: 0px; font-size: 14px; margin-bottom: 15px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; display: block; line-height: 22px; word-break: break-word; color: rgb(32, 32, 32); font-family: Inter, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\">What You Should Do Next</div><div class=\"line\" style=\"border: 0px; font-size: 14px; margin-bottom: 15px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; display: block; line-height: 22px; word-break: break-word; color: rgb(32, 32, 32); font-family: Inter, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\">\u2705 Create Utility Templates \u2013 Transition critical messaging from marketing to utility templates to avoid disruptions.</div><div class=\"line\" style=\"border: 0px; font-size: 14px; margin-bottom: 15px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; display: block; line-height: 22px; word-break: break-word; color: rgb(32, 32, 32); font-family: Inter, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\">\u2705 Leverage Click-to-WhatsApp Ads \u2013 Engage customers through direct WhatsApp conversations triggered by ads.</div><div class=\"line\" style=\"border: 0px; font-size: 14px; margin-bottom: 15px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; display: block; line-height: 22px; word-break: break-word; color: rgb(32, 32, 32); font-family: Inter, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\">\u2705 Utilize the 24-Hour Customer Service Window \u2013 Maximize engagement with real-time responses.</div><div class=\"line\" style=\"border: 0px; font-size: 14px; margin-bottom: 15px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; display: block; line-height: 22px; word-break: break-word; color: rgb(32, 32, 32); font-family: Inter, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\">Key Dates to Remember</div><div class=\"line\" style=\"border: 0px; font-size: 14px; margin-bottom: 15px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; display: block; line-height: 22px; word-break: break-word; color: rgb(32, 32, 32); font-family: Inter, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\">\u2022 &nbsp; &nbsp;Pause Start Date: April 1, 2025</div><div class=\"line\" style=\"border: 0px; font-size: 14px; margin-bottom: 15px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; display: block; line-height: 22px; word-break: break-word; color: rgb(32, 32, 32); font-family: Inter, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\">\u2022 &nbsp; &nbsp;Pause End Date: TBD \u2013 Meta will reassess based on market engagement.</div><div class=\"line\" style=\"border: 0px; font-size: 14px; margin-bottom: 15px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; display: block; line-height: 22px; word-break: break-word; color: rgb(32, 32, 32); font-family: Inter, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\">Permitted WhatsApp Business Activities During the Pause</div><div class=\"line\" style=\"border: 0px; font-size: 14px; margin-bottom: 15px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; display: block; line-height: 22px; word-break: break-word; color: rgb(32, 32, 32); font-family: Inter, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\">\u2714 Utility Conversations \u2013 Order updates, appointment confirmations, transactional alerts.</div><div class=\"line\" style=\"border: 0px; font-size: 14px; margin-bottom: 15px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; display: block; line-height: 22px; word-break: break-word; color: rgb(32, 32, 32); font-family: Inter, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\">\u2714 Authentication Messages \u2013 One-time passwords, account verifications.</div><div class=\"line\" style=\"border: 0px; font-size: 14px; margin-bottom: 15px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; display: block; line-height: 22px; word-break: break-word; color: rgb(32, 32, 32); font-family: Inter, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\">\u2714 Service Conversations \u2013 Replies within the 24-hour customer service window.</div><div class=\"line\" style=\"border: 0px; font-size: 14px; margin-bottom: 15px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; display: block; line-height: 22px; word-break: break-word; color: rgb(32, 32, 32); font-family: Inter, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\">\u2714 Click-to-WhatsApp Ads \u2013 Drive customer interactions with targeted ad campaigns.</div><div class=\"line\" style=\"border: 0px; font-size: 14px; margin-bottom: 15px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; display: block; line-height: 22px; word-break: break-word; color: rgb(32, 32, 32); font-family: Inter, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\">We recommend reviewing and adjusting your messaging strategy now to ensure uninterrupted communication with your U.S.-based customers. Stay tuned for further updates and the upcoming release of our Template Migrator!</div><div class=\"line\" style=\"border: 0px; font-size: 14px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; display: block; line-height: 22px; word-break: break-word; color: rgb(32, 32, 32); font-family: Inter, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><a href=\"https://developers.facebook.com/docs/whatsapp/cloud-api/guides/send-message-templates/\" rel=\"ugc nofollow noopener\" style=\"border: 0px; font-size: 14px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(16, 185, 129); transition: 0.1s ease-in-out;\" target=\"_blank\">Read More here</a></div>\n\t"}, {"slug": "155000003281-instagram-dm-workflow-action", "title": "Instagram DM - Workflow Action", "folder": "Conversations View", "images": ["../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155032172309/original/A5nUsbICOH6zfl8PWDV95dtTUJ0MkuFCWw05a9.png?1725374911", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155032197916/original/juAYymnfJ7zofz79ybgAxLHivhFPaU3KIwef84.png?1725424010"], "videos": [], "content": "\n\t\t<h3 data-identifyelement=\"501\" dir=\"ltr\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"502\" dir=\"ltr\"><span data-identifyelement=\"503\" style=\"font-size: 16px;\">Instagram DM - Action:</span></strong></h3><p data-identifyelement=\"504\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span data-identifyelement=\"505\" style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><br data-identifyelement=\"506\"></span></p><p data-identifyelement=\"507\" dir=\"ltr\"><span data-identifyelement=\"508\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 16px;\">The workflow action Instagram DM allows you to send an Instagram DM to the contact (contact needs to have previously messaged a connected Instagram page no more than 24 hours before arriving at this event in order for the message to successfully deliver)</span></p><p data-identifyelement=\"509\" dir=\"ltr\"><br data-identifyelement=\"510\"></p><p data-identifyelement=\"511\" dir=\"ltr\"><br data-identifyelement=\"512\"></p><p data-identifyelement=\"513\" dir=\"ltr\"><img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155032172309/original/A5nUsbICOH6zfl8PWDV95dtTUJ0MkuFCWw05a9.png?1725374911\" style=\"width: auto; max-width: 100%;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"155032172309\" data-identifyelement=\"514\"></p><p data-identifyelement=\"515\"><br></p><p data-identifyelement=\"515\" dir=\"ltr\"><span data-identifyelement=\"502\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; display: inline !important;\">You can select from pre existing templates or even right your own message.You<span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; display: inline !important;\">&nbsp;</span><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; display: inline !important;\">also</span><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; display: inline !important;\">&nbsp;</span><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; display: inline !important;\">have the ability to attach files. Click on \"Add attachment\" and select an attachment from your drive or enter the URL to add the files.</span></span></span></p><p data-identifyelement=\"515\"><br data-identifyelement=\"501\"></p><p data-identifyelement=\"515\" dir=\"ltr\"><span data-identifyelement=\"502\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 16px;\">Use this action with the Trigger - \"Customer Replied\" and reply channel is \"Instagram DM\".&nbsp;</span></p><p data-identifyelement=\"515\" dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p data-identifyelement=\"515\" dir=\"ltr\"><span data-identifyelement=\"504\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"505\" dir=\"ltr\">Please Note:&nbsp;</strong></span></p><ul data-identifyelement=\"506\"><li data-identifyelement=\"515\" dir=\"ltr\"><span data-identifyelement=\"507\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 16px;\">This action should be used to send DMs to contacts only if the contact has sent a DM in last 24 hours.&nbsp;</span></li><li data-identifyelement=\"515\" dir=\"ltr\"><span data-identifyelement=\"508\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 16px;\">If this action is used with \"Instagram Comment(s) on Post\" workflow trigger,&nbsp;</span><ul data-identifyelement=\"509\"><li data-identifyelement=\"561\" style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span data-identifyelement=\"562\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 16px;\">DM will be sent as a Reply to Comment if there is any recent comment on your Instagram post.</span></li><li data-identifyelement=\"563\" style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span data-identifyelement=\"564\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 16px;\">DM will be sent as a Direct DM if there is no recent comment, provided the contact has sent a DM to your business within the last 24 hours.</span></li></ul></li></ul><p data-identifyelement=\"517\" dir=\"ltr\"><br data-identifyelement=\"510\"></p><p data-identifyelement=\"568\" style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span data-identifyelement=\"569\" style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"570\">Recommendation:</strong></span></p><p data-identifyelement=\"571\"><br data-identifyelement=\"572\"></p><p data-identifyelement=\"573\"><span data-identifyelement=\"574\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 16px;\">Use the \"Instagram Interactive Messenger\" action, to send Instagram DMs to contacts. &nbsp;</span></p><ul data-identifyelement=\"511\"><li data-identifyelement=\"573\"><span data-identifyelement=\"574\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 16px;\">If you are replying to a comment, set the Reply Type as Reply to Comment via DM</span></li><li data-identifyelement=\"573\"><span data-identifyelement=\"574\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 16px;\">If you are sending a direct DM, set the Reply Type as \"Reply to DM\"&nbsp;</span></li></ul><p data-identifyelement=\"573\"><br></p><p data-identifyelement=\"573\"><span data-identifyelement=\"574\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 16px;\">You can view more details on \"Instagram Interactive Messenger\" Action - <a data-identifyelement=\"575\" href=\"155000002188-facebook-instagram-interactive-messenger.html\">Here</a>.</span></p><p data-identifyelement=\"573\"><br data-identifyelement=\"512\"></p><p data-identifyelement=\"573\"><img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155032197916/original/juAYymnfJ7zofz79ybgAxLHivhFPaU3KIwef84.png?1725424010\" style=\"width: auto; max-width: 100%;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"155032197916\" data-identifyelement=\"513\"></p><p data-identifyelement=\"573\"><br data-identifyelement=\"514\"></p><p data-identifyelement=\"573\"><br data-identifyelement=\"515\"></p><p data-identifyelement=\"573\"><br data-identifyelement=\"516\"></p><p data-identifyelement=\"519\" dir=\"ltr\"><span data-identifyelement=\"520\" style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"521\" dir=\"ltr\">Note:&nbsp;</strong></span></p><p data-identifyelement=\"517\"><br data-identifyelement=\"518\"></p><p data-identifyelement=\"519\"><span data-identifyelement=\"520\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 16px;\">Previously, until August 31, 2024, you were able to send a direct message to any contact who commented on your Instagram post via the \"Instagram DM\" workflow action, regardless of whether they had sent a DM to your business within the last 24 hours. This was due to a bug on Meta's end, which has now been resolved.</span></p><p data-identifyelement=\"521\"><br data-identifyelement=\"522\"></p><p data-identifyelement=\"536\"><br data-identifyelement=\"537\"></p><p data-identifyelement=\"579\" dir=\"ltr\"><br data-identifyelement=\"580\"></p>\n\t"}, {"slug": "48001239779-leadconnector-webchat-for-shopify-how-to-get-started", "title": "LeadConnector Webchat for Shopify: How to Get Started", "folder": "WebChat Widget", "images": ["../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/48297596658/original/PSsUcBbLJWJKhtf5HfaJApA-SnuxjakuYw166a.gif?1684167749", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/48297327387/original/Xo0wZGJkc3cetfK5pkEHnbLEqKKVYkMMbQ5bab.jpg?1683926759", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/48297327386/original/Na1JE2ESDFLGPh9FlOa3HgnYSXpg23FAkA5bab.jpg?1683926759", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/48297327380/original/HBRae8Gcy0FfwAMHQGIXtLY7973APBmdtg5bab.png?1683926759", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/48297327383/original/EapE6bR1rjU8x9KAx6BKgkx_JsYvceQbpw5bab.jpg?1683926759", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/48297327382/original/HNLFBinrelhZHO3a_FDjxSHnogvs7bXbbA5bab.jpg?1683926759", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/48297327381/original/BPtt2-YEGJ4uatoEbuusWWpgAi4rYOruqg5bab.jpg?1683926759"], "videos": [], "content": "\n\t\t<p data-identifyelement=\"480\"><span data-identifyelement=\"481\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system,